 identified P0s for the MVP "},{"type":"link","url":"https://docs.google.com/document/d/17nn7wqA4eOAZ76itPoMjsRbu0E-fgNUWcAl7WfTtKN4/edit?tab=t.6pe1nmbmyrx6","text":"here"},{"type":"text","text":". I am working on getting this all into an asana board where it will be easy to edit and move these elements from milestones or priorities, but wanted to get this to you so we can keep the momentum going with scoping."}]}]}]},{"client_msg_id":"e17e77d1-1656-48ca-9654-0cfa10aaff1f","type":"message","user":"U08HPM99N80","text":"Note that the monetization sections are in red – there's still a lot to work out there so will update as that is done. But would like to move forward with everything else we are able to","ts":"1746556506.728809","team":"T01E0D9F1NW","reactions":[{"name":"white_check_mark","count":1,"users":["U06JQHRF6HJ"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U06TP3HRUKV"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"metadata":{"event_type":"","event_payload":null},"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dj03G","elements":[{"type":"rich_text_section","elements":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that the monetization sections are in red – there's still a lot to work out there so will update as that is done. But would like to move forward with everything else we are able to"}]}]}]},{"client_msg_id":"449999bc-5e1e-4aad-bda9-490d7ef235ce","type":"message","user":"U08HPM99N80","text":"Hi \u003c@U02GQL9QG9G\u003e\u003c@U05BV05GYQH\u003e\u003c@U06JQHRF6HJ\u003e\u003c@U06TP3HRUKV\u003e, \u003chttps://app.asana.com/1/1206660498759239/project/1209804360535535/list/1209816214785719|here\u003e is the Asana board for the MVP. Some things to know:\n\n• Anytime something is marked as \"P2\" priority, it will automatically move to the \"Future Milestones\" section\n• All tasks have `tags` associated with them, so if something is moved to a future milestone, we can still easily see what section or area of the app it is related to. \n    ◦ This also allows us to see all areas of the app a task touches or is part of\n• I'm eventually going to add in a milestone field as well so we can sort by milestone, but wanted to start here with just the basic features\n• *P0.5* = things we need but could explore building outside of the app for MVP, like creator insights and story suggestions\n• I have not assigned any of these tasks to specific people, I will let \u003c@U05BV05GYQH\u003e \u003c@U06JQHRF6HJ\u003e \u003c@U06TP3HRUKV\u003e team make those assignments and set target completion dates together based on scoping\n• I've attached the MVP doc to the project and set milestone dates. \n    ◦ Please feel free to add notes, subtasks, related documents, etc. ","ts":"1747939557.088639","team":"T01E0D9F1NW","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U05BV05GYQH"]},{"name":"white_check_mark","count":1,"users":["U06TP3HRUKV"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"metadata":{"event_type":"","event_payload":null},"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lSfmk","elements":[{"type":"rich_text_section","elements":[{"type":"text","text":"Hi "},{"type":"user","user_id":"U02GQL9QG9G"},{"type":"user","user_id":"U05BV05GYQH"},{"type":"user","user_id":"U06JQHRF6HJ"},{"type":"user","user_id":"U06TP3HRUKV"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"link","url":"https://app.asana.com/1/1206660498759239/project/1209804360535535/list/1209816214785719","text":"here","style":{}},{"type":"text","text":" is the Asana board for the MVP. Some things to know:\n\n"}]},{"type":"rich_text_list","elements":[{"type":"rich_text_section","elements":[{"type":"text","text":"Anytime something is marked as \"P2\" priority, it will automatically move to the \"Future Milestones\" section"}]},{"type":"rich_text_section","elements":[{"type":"text","text":"All tasks have "},{"type":"text","text":"tags","style":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" associated with them, so if something is moved to a future milestone, we can still easily see what section or area of the app it is related